#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`apds9960` --- Proximity, Gesture, and Color Sensor Driver"
msgstr ""
":mod:`apds9960` --- upravljački program za senzor blizine, gesta i boje"

#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module provides a driver for the Broadcom/Avago APDS9960 digital "
"proximity, ambient-light, RGB color, and gesture sensor over I2C. The driver"
" exposes per-feature enable/disable controls, raw channel reads (clear, R, "
"G, B, proximity), and a software gesture-decoding state machine that "
"classifies swipe up/down/left/right and near/far gestures from the on-chip "
"4-photodiode FIFO."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul pruža upravljački program za digitalni senzor blizine, "
"ambijentalnog svjetla, RGB boje i gesta Broadcom/Avago APDS9960 preko I2C. "
"Upravljački program izlaže kontrole omogućavanja/onemogućavanja po značajki,"
" čitanja sirovih kanala (clear, R, G, B, blizina) te softverski stroj stanja"
" za dekodiranje gesta koji klasificira prelazak prema "
"gore/dolje/lijevo/desno i geste približavanja/udaljavanja iz ugrađenog "
"FIFO-a s 4 fotodiode."

