#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:385
msgid ""
"MicroPython subclass of :class:`APDS9960`. Identical public API, but the "
"underlying register access uses ``machine.I2C``-style ``readfrom_mem`` and "
"``writeto_mem`` calls rather than SMBus-style methods. This is the class to "
"use on OpenMV / MicroPython targets."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython podklasa klase :class:`APDS9960`\\ . Identičan javni API, ali "
"pripadajući pristup registrima koristi pozive u stilu ``machine.I2C`` "
"``readfrom_mem`` i ``writeto_mem`` umjesto metoda u SMBus stilu. Ovo je "
"klasa koju treba koristiti na OpenMV / MicroPython ciljnim uređajima."

